3736:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  * Then call this API to start the external timer.
3737:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  *
3738:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Can/Std/IfxCan.h ****  * \param[inout] node Specifies the pointer to CAN node registers.
