 287:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * shall not be used to initialize the CSA of another CPU.
 288:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 289:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \param[inout] csaBegin Pointer to the beginning address of the CSA region.
